<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Nevaeh Workspace — Lightek</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/nevaeh/os.css?v=6"><%= csrf_meta_tags %></head>
<body><a class="skip-link" href="#q">Skip to conversation</a>
<div class="app">
<aside class="navigation" aria-label="Nevaeh navigation">
<a class="brand" href="/dashboard"><span class="brand-mark">L</span>LIGHTEK <span class="back">/</span></a>
<div class="workspace-label">YOUR WORKSPACE</div>
<a class="nav-item active" href="/dashboard/nevaeh" aria-current="page">◈ <span>Conversation</span></a>
<a class="nav-item" href="/dashboard/nevaeh/guide">▤ <span>Guide &amp; capabilities</span></a>
<a class="nav-item" href="/dashboard/studio-broadcasting">▣ <span>Studio</span></a>
<button class="nav-item" data-command="/produce personalities">◇ <span>Character personalities</span></button>
<a class="nav-item" id="learning-link" hidden href="/employee/nevaeh/factory">◇ <span>Learning &amp; study</span></a>
<div class="section-heading"><h2>Your team</h2><button id="gen" class="icon-button" aria-label="Create an agent">+</button></div><div id="ags"></div>
<details class="sidebar-detail"><summary>Workers &amp; schedules</summary><div class="quick"><button data-command="/agents">All workers</button><a href="/dashboard/nevaeh/guide?topic=agents">How to delegate</a></div><div id="agent-jobs"></div></details>
<details class="sidebar-detail" id="watcher-tools" hidden><summary>Watchers</summary><button data-command="/watch list">All watchers</button><div id="watcher-list"></div></details>
<details class="sidebar-detail" id="host-tools" hidden><summary>Server &amp; applications</summary><div class="quick"><button data-command="/ubuntu status">Server status</button><button data-command="/models">Data console</button></div><label class="upload-label">Add application input<input id="app-upload" type="file"></label></details>
<div class="nav-footer"><span id="connection" role="status">Connecting…</span><small id="model-count">Loading model status</small><a href="/dashboard">← Back to Dashboard</a></div>
</aside>
<main id="core" class="core">
<header class="workspace-header"><div><span class="eyebrow">LIGHTEK INTELLIGENCE</span><h1 id="rn">Nevaeh</h1><p id="rl">Operating intelligence</p></div><button class="btn" data-command="/briefing">Today's briefing</button></header>
<div class="conversation">
<section class="welcome" id="welcome"><div class="avatar">N<span></span></div><span class="eyebrow">LET'S GET TO WORK</span><h2>What are we<br>creating today?</h2><p>Build a production. Run your business. Teach me something new.<br>Your tools, team, and work come together here.</p>
<div class="starter-grid"><button data-draft="make me a funny tiktok campaign ad promoting "><span>01 / CREATE</span><strong>Turn an idea into a campaign</strong><small>Script, storyboard, music &amp; a private preview</small></button><button data-draft="make a 22 minute comedy episode called "><span>02 / DIRECT</span><strong>Start your next episode</strong><small>Use your production recipes &amp; show bibles</small></button><button data-command="/agents"><span>03 / DELEGATE</span><strong>Put your team to work</strong><small>Workers, schedules &amp; execution status</small></button><button data-command="/guide"><span>04 / EXPLORE</span><strong>See what I can do</strong><small>Guided tutorials &amp; available capabilities</small></button></div></section>
<div id="trail" class="conversation-trail" aria-label="Conversation history"></div>
<article id="ans" class="answer"><div class="request"><span>YOU</span><p id="aq"></p></div><div class="response"><b id="aa">Nevaeh</b><div id="at" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div><div id="receipt"></div><div id="atags" class="tags"></div><div id="mem" class="mem"><span id="mt"></span><button class="btn" id="my">Remember</button><button class="btn" id="mn">Not this</button></div></div></article>
</div>
<div class="composer"><div class="composer-toolbar"><div class="modes" id="modes" aria-label="Conversation mode"><button class="on" aria-pressed="true">Converse</button><button aria-pressed="false">Operate</button><button aria-pressed="false">Decide</button><button aria-pressed="false">Reflect</button></div><button id="spk" class="text-button" aria-pressed="false">Read replies aloud</button></div><form id="f"><label class="sr-only" for="q">Your request to Nevaeh</label><textarea id="q" rows="2" maxlength="4000" placeholder="Tell me what you want to make or do…"></textarea><div class="composer-actions"><span id="mode-help">Ask questions and run supported requests.</span><button class="btn" id="mic" type="button" aria-pressed="false">Voice</button><button class="btn primary" type="submit">Send request</button></div></form><p class="composer-note">Actions follow your account permissions. Preview work with Decide or Reflect.</p></div>
</main>
<aside class="inspector" aria-label="Task details"><div class="section-heading"><h2>Your activity</h2><button class="text-button" data-command="/status">View all</button></div><div id="operations" class="operations" aria-live="polite"></div><details open><summary>Sources &amp; execution evidence</summary><div id="inf"><p class="empty">References and action evidence appear with each response.</p></div></details><details><summary>Memory &amp; preferences <span id="rc">0</span></summary><p class="empty">Choose what Nevaeh can remember. Disabling a category deletes its memories.</p><div id="mc"></div><div id="rem"></div></details><details><summary>Workspace activity</summary><div id="lint"></div></details><div class="principles"><span class="eyebrow">GROUNDED IN PRINCIPLE</span><p>Truth · Trust · Justice<br>Mercy · Excellence</p><small>Sources, permissions, and receipts make the work inspectable.</small></div></aside>
</div>
<dialog id="mo"><form id="gf"><span class="eyebrow">YOUR TEAM</span><h2>Create an agent</h2><label>Name<input name="n" required maxlength="18" placeholder="e.g. Noor"></label><label>Role<input name="role" required maxlength="120" placeholder="e.g. Production coordinator"></label><p class="empty">Agents work within your account permissions. Assign real work through delegation.</p><div class="dialog-actions"><button class="btn" type="button" id="gx">Cancel</button><button class="btn primary" type="submit">Create agent</button></div></form></dialog>
<div class="toast" id="toast" role="status"></div><script src="/nevaeh/os.js?v=6" defer></script></body></html>
